      "content": "<p>Values of work function (W<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.101ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.9 436.6 486.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) for a few metals are given below</p>\n<p>\n<table class=\"tg\" style=\"undefined;table-layout: fixed; width: 587px\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 96px\">\n<col style=\"width: 90px\">\n<col style=\"width: 82px\">\n<col style=\"width: 80px\">\n<col style=\"width: 79px\">\n<col style=\"width: 76px\">\n<col style=\"width: 84px\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-0lax\">Metal</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-0lax\">Li</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-0lax\">Na</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-0lax\">K</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-0lax\">Mg</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-0lax\">Cu</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-0lax\">Ag</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">W<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.101ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.9 436.6 486.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>/eV</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">2.42</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">2.3</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">2.25</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">3.7</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">4.8</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">4.3</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>The number of metals which will show photoelectric effect when light of wavelength <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.894ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3489 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> falls on it is ___________</p>\n<p>Given: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19.996ex\" height=\"2.425ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.8 8838.2 1071.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" da